Mia107 TensorFold prefill source port

This package modifies seven files of the TensorFold source distributed in the
immutable MiaAI-Lab Mia107 image. Selected changes are adapted from MiaAI-Lab's
TP4 branch, commit d22003070575c2774de0f010062aa57bae06f3c7, patches 0101 (only
small-head launch choice), 0102, 0104, 0105 and 0107. The port preserves Mia107 CUDA
score/onepass dispatch and DFlash prelaunch, excludes optional MSA and BF16
partials, and adds explicit 4|8 small-head launch control/arithmetic identity.

Copyright 2026 MiaAI-Lab and TensorFold contributors. The adapted patches and
the source they modify retain Apache-2.0 and the historical TensorFold MIT
notice where applicable. See licenses/ and provenance.json for exact sources.
New builder/tests in this directory use Apache-2.0.

Design credit retained from the new own_front.py and microbatch.py modules:
drowzeys (https://github.com/drowzeys/TensorFold, glm53-tp4-2026-10-05) designed
the replicated-front sequence partitioning and two-microbatch communication
pipeline followed by MiaAI-Lab; the module comments state no code was copied.
MiaAI-Lab's complete upstream NOTICE is retained in licenses/Mia-NOTICE.

The source-manifest.json includes historical direct-diagonal NCCL point-to-point
qualification status. Network/adaptor relay implementation and current runtime
qualification are outside this engine port. No modelweights or NVIDIA runtime
binaries are distributed by this source package.
